MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Mannheim Steamroller Christmas, Symphony II connects both to my repeated Christmas listening and to Holiday Symphony, giving me a concrete reason to try it first.",
    "Tis The Season and Christmas At Downton Abbey fit the holiday theme that appears repeatedly in my history, so they feel relevant enough to consider."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Very Best Of and The Definitive Collection do not identify whose music I would hear, so I cannot connect them to my listening interests.",
    "Partners, A Musical Affair, Cheek to Cheek, The White Rose, and Stages leave me unsure why I would enjoy them. During a brief visit, that uncertainty is enough for me to pass."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The selections seem to assume that a broad connection to album listening is enough, while I need a recognizable connection to music I have chosen.",
    "A seasonal theme gets my attention, but it does not make every Christmas album equally appealing or equally likely to be my next choice."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The combination of Christmas music and the symphonic connection matters more to my first choice than a holiday title alone.",
    "My Christmas interactions were clustered in November 2014, while my latest interaction was The New Old Fashioned in September 2016. My older holiday listening does not establish that I want only Christmas music now."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my holiday listening, but only a few give me a specific enough connection to act on during a brief visit."
}
